"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":118,"digest":"sha256:46ebf9dba078e5e7a57570f071ea30fb5c16c60045d12f61fa373ff3a93702a0","download_count":7,"created_at":"2026-09-26T01:10:48Z","updated_at":"2026-09-26T01:10:48Z"},{"id":589626564,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4jJPzE","name":"DBX_0.6.24_x64.dmg","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":39512789,"digest":"sha256:6adcc370086cfe85f918efdef4cdf5f8aaf48f87cb808f93f3f2316b5539f4a8","download_count":31,"created_at":"2026-09-26T01:12:32Z","updated_at":"2026-09-26T01:12:34Z"},{"id":589574240,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4jJDBg","name":"DBX_0.6.24_x64_en-US.msi","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":34787328,"digest":"sha256:241fe172fe50d14e493b0719bc4bb4b92494a61fe7a994805e76fb4f25302952","download_count":20,"created_at":"2026-09-26T00:45:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-26T00:45:07Z"},{"id":589626597,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4jJPzl","name":"DBX_x64.app.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":39459537,"digest":"sha256:d12af7758b02e1c7979311fafed131483ebf5d63243854a48595bca55a1abedc","download_count":30,"created_at":"2026-09-26T01:12:34Z","updated_at":"2026-09-26T01:12:36Z"},{"id":589647256,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4jJU2Y","name":"latest.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":17599,"digest":"sha256:e6d3c53e37228a86858604ecf695cbfb0cf09999285098d9733c5117879edc5a","download_count":2598,"created_at":"2026-09-26T01:22:38Z","updated_at":"2026-09-26T01:22:38Z"}],"body":"### 新功能\n- DBX MCP 新增原生独立安装，设置页可一键切换并保留 npm 安装作为兜底，MCP 服务端新增资源发现（resources）能力\n- 设置页新增 Web/Docker 版 MCP HTTP 访问管理，支持访问密码、Host/Origin 白名单与令牌轮换 (contributed by @HandSonic) (PR [#10294](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10294))\n- 数据字典 PDF 导出改为后台任务，关闭向导不再中断导出，可在任务面板查看进度与结果 (contributed by @caichangqing1120) (PR [#10304](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10304))\n- 表结构 DDL 弹框支持四边四角拖拽缩放，双击标题栏可最大化与还原 (contributed by @ma123456mai) (PR [#10293](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10293))\n- 对象浏览器中打开表时默认显示 DDL 页签，「表信息」页签仍可切换 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#10314](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10314))\n### 改进\n- 更新中心改用紧凑单行列表样式并为页签增加下划线指示\n### 修复\n- PostgreSQL 9.2–9.4 结构同步不再生成 CREATE INDEX / CREATE SEQUENCE 的 IF NOT EXISTS，低版本可正常执行 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10326](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10326))\n- 修复 PostgreSQL 9.x 查看表结构 DDL 与导出序列失败的问题 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10306](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10306))\n- 结构同步创建目标序列时不再引用源库的默认值 (contributed by @thanadon-dev) (PR [#10299](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10299))\n- MySQL 兼容引擎拒绝补全元数据查询时自动回退，代码补全不再失败 (contributed by @CN-Scars) (PR [#10305](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10305))\n- 连接 MyCAT、DBLE 等 MySQL 中间件时表清单可正常加载\n- Doris 连接正确应用 MySQL TLS 配置 (contributed by @CN-Scars) (PR [#10320](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10320))\n- SQL Server 查看与导出 DDL 保留计算列原始定义，不再写成派生结果类型 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10290](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10290))\n- SQL Server（旧驱动）视图与触发器的「查看 DDL」返回对象定义，不再报 Unsupported object type (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10279](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10279))\n- OceanBase Oracle 模式打开部分存储过程不再界面无响应，PL 源码优先从 ALL_SOURCE 读取\n- 修复 Caché/IRIS 表数据分页 offset 失效与总行数统计 SQL 引用错误 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10311](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10311))\n- IRIS %Boolean 列按存储值显示 1/0，不再显示 true/false (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10298](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10298))\n- Vastbase 结果集列名大写时按主键保存与删除行不再被拒绝 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10329](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10329))\n- DuckDB 的 TIMESTAMPTZ 值按会话时区渲染 (contributed by @caichangqing1120) (PR [#10301](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10301))\n- GBase 8s 路由式创建数据库对话框正确显示语言/字符集选择器 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#10280](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10280))\n- SQL 格式化时行注释不再吞掉后续的列、分隔符与语句结束符 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10289](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10289))\n- 补全在单条语句 FROM 表后的空行处不再丢失表上下文 (contributed by @dienaso) (PR [#10318](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10318))\n- 修复 PostgreSQL 批量字段选择弹窗按上下键消失、勾选框无法勾选的问题 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10315](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10315))\n- 结构比较点击「修改类型」的表时正确定位并聚焦对应 DDL 变更\n- 网格 SQL 预览面板 Ctrl+A 全选预览文本而非表格数据 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10292](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10292))\n- 查询网格滚动条保持在粘性表头下方，不再叠在表头上 (contributed by @thanadon-dev) (PR [#10297](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10297))\n- 侧边栏翻页窗口漂移时重读已显示范围，不再漏行 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10277](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10277))\n- 侧边栏粘性分组标题不再跨越连接边界错位显示\n- 视图源码保存后 Save 按钮不再一直转圈，可再次保存 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10322](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10322))\n- 插件变更后前端 contributions 实时刷新，无需重启 (contributed by @0verme) (PR [#10319](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10319))\n- 插件卸载失败时状态保持一致，可重试 (contributed by @0verme) (PR [#10323](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10323))\n- 插件在插件中心外更新后全局图标缓存正确失效 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#10291](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10291))\n- 插件市场卡片在窄面板下版本徽标不再被裁切 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#10285](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10285))\n- MCP 发现过程跳过没有 mcp/tools 能力的插件，不再整体中断 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#10286](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10286))\n- AI 助手输入区控件在空间不足时自动收拢，不再溢出 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#10325](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10325))\n- JSON 文件导入改为流式解析，取消 100 MB 体积上限 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10327](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10327))\n- SQL 大文件导入按缓冲字节分批刷写，不再长时间无进度与内存暴涨 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10321](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10321))\n- Windows 上 SSH 隧道支持通过 OpenSSH Agent（命名管道）认证\n- Windows 上不再因 dbx-mcp 拉起的 Java agent 锁定 JRE 目录与 agent.jar 导致驱动更新失败\n- 离线部署包按远端架构正确安装 SQLite SSH Worker (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10330](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10330))\n- 修复 macOS 12 旧 WKWebView 下的 UI 渲染问题（更新中心角标与警示徽标显示为实心块、激活页签无背景等） (contributed by @wzlstudy) (PR [#10284](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10284))\n- 自定义背景图下弹窗保持不透明，SQL 参数等内容清晰可读 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10295](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10295))\n- 面板分隔条拖拽手柄在分隔槽内居中显示 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#10324](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10324))\n- Deep link 冷启动时直接打开对应连接，不再只打开应用主窗口\n- 支持信息中 Windows 显示营销名称（如 Windows 11） (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#10281](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10281))\n- 更新中心不再显示 Release Note 中的 HTML 注释标记\n- 启动时更早加载 SQL 库已保存的文件，不再长时间不显示\n- 修复启动阶段逐条连接重复访问系统凭据库导致 SQL 库与连接列表加载缓慢的问题 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10310](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10310))\n\n---\n<!-- dbx-cnb-mirror -->\n> 国内下载：如果 GitHub 下载较慢，可从 [CNB 镜像](https://cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx/-/releases/tag/v0.6.24) 下载桌面端安装包，Docker 镜像从 `docker.cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx:v0.6.24` 拉取。\n","reactions":{"total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":11}
